    "description": "Digital credential products for workforce identity and compliance. Credivera operates the Credivera Exchange, a SaaS platform for organizations to issue or request proof of work-related credentials: education, training, certification, background checks, insurance, identity, etc. Credivera's engine, VCI, uses open standards (W3C, ISO, OpenID, IETF) for digital credential issuance, exchange and verification. Credivera's wallets, mobile and web, use open standards for accepting, managing and presenting digital credentials.",
